Future Outlook
The future of the fire fighting vehicle market is expected to be shaped by:
•	Electrification: Development of electric fire trucks for reduced emissions and noise, especially in urban areas.
•	Automation and Robotics: Increased use of remote-controlled and autonomous vehicles for dangerous situations.
•	Modular and Multi-Role Vehicles: Vehicles that can be quickly reconfigured for different types of fires or emergencies.
•	Enhanced Safety Features: Integration of AI, real-time monitoring, and better crew safety systems.
Moreover, the rise of smart cities and IoT will integrate firefighting vehicles into broader emergency response networks, allowing for real-time data sharing and coordinated actions.
